  url = {https://www.dlib.si/details/URN:NBN:SI:DOC-TMG3QFI9},
  note = {Role: foundational. Project inspiration and scientific foundation for the early studies and methods. Later additions include independent methods, connectors, databases and applications with their own sources; this thesis is not the source of every repository component. University of Ljubljana catalogue: COBISS 77808131; national-library URN:NBN:SI:DOC-TMG3QFI9. Defended 21 September 2021. Marko Topič is the advisor, not a coauthor. No thesis DOI has been verified. Citation does not claim that every thesis chapter is implemented. CCYA implementation follows sections 7.5.1–7.5.3 (pp. 150–164), with equations 3.6/3.8 for thermal context. The institutional full text is https://repozitorij.uni-lj.si/Dokument.php?id=148326\&lang=eng. Explicit choices for monthly centroid scaling, incremental temperature normalization, nonexceedance quantiles and cumulative ratio versus signed gain are documented in docs/ccya.md; no numerical reproduction of Bolzano is claimed. Soiling and snow indicators follow Eqs. 3.2–3.4 (pp. 49–51) and Tables 6.6–6.7 (pp. 135–136), with explicit equality/low-domain conventions and alternative example data documented in docs/soiling-snow.md.}
}

